  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>The topographic data includes constructed and natural features that make up Ontario’s landscape.</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>The cache provides limited data from areas outside Ontario’s boundaries, such as the United States and adjacent provinces and territories.</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Les données topographiques comprennent à la fois les caractéristiques bâties et naturelles qui composent les paysages de l’Ontario.</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Le cache ne fournit que des données limitées sur les zones situées en dehors des frontières de l’Ontario, comme aux États-Unis et dans les provinces et territoires adjacents.</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Technical information / Renseignements techniques</strong></span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Two versions of the Topographic Data Cache are available:</span></div><ol><li><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>The vector version is suitable for online web map applications as well as modern GIS software and is updated twice a year.</span></li><li><span style='font-family:inherit;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; display:inline !important; line-height:1.5; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>The final update to the </span></span><a style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(0, 97, 155); font-family:inherit; line-height:1.5; text-decoration:none;' target='_blank' href='https://geohub.lio.gov.on.ca/datasets/mnrf::lio-topographic-data-cache/about' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='font-family:inherit;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; display:inline !important; line-height:1.5; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>traditional raster version</span></span></a><span style='font-family:inherit;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; display:inline !important; line-height:1.5; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'> was completed in September 2025 and the service will be discontinued in 2028.</span></span></li></ol><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Contributing data layers may have different maintenance and update cycles. Some cache layers have been processed in a way that makes it easier for them to be displayed in a mapping product. Other layers are unchanged from the authoritative data.</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>The cartographic symbology used in the data cache is intentionally muted to allow users to showcase their data.</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>The Ontario Vector Topographic Data Cache is created from many source datasets, which are described in the Ontario Topographic Data Cache user guide. If you are interested in getting this authoritative data, you can download it from the </span><a target='_blank' href='https://geohub.lio.gov.on.ca/' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Ontario GeoHub</span></a><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>.</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>To download a copy of the Vector Cache, visit the </span><a target='_blank' href='https://mnrf.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=70587254227d44f78654152c1e0c5069' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Ontario Vector Topographic Data Cache Package</span></a><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'> site, and click 'Download'.</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><p><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Il existe deux versions de la cache de données topographiques:</span></p><ol><li><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>La version vectorielle, qui est conçue pour les applications cartographiques sur le Web ainsi que pour les logiciels SIG récents, et qui est mise à jour deux fois par année.</span></li><li><span style='font-family:inherit;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; display:inline !important; line-height:1.5; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>La dernière mise à jour de la version </span></span><a style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(0, 97, 155); font-family:inherit; line-height:1.5; text-decoration:none;' target='_blank' href='https://geohub-fr.lio.gov.on.ca/maps/3bc7db15c600419ab26278770b6d7d5f/about' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='font-family:inherit;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; display:inline !important; line-height:1.5; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>raster traditionnelle</span></span></a><span style='font-family:inherit;'><span style='border:0px solid currentcolor; box-sizing:border-box; display:inline !important; line-height:1.5; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'> a été effectuée en septembre 2025, et le service sera retiré en 2028.</span></span></li></ol></div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Les couches de données contributives peuvent avoir des cycles de maintenance différents.</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Certaines couches ont été traitées d’une façon qui les rend faciles à afficher dans un produit de cartographie. D’autres n’ont connu aucune modification par rapport aux données faisant autorité.</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Les symboles cartographiques employés dans le cache sont dissimulés intentionnellement, de façon à ce que l’utilisateur puisse mieux présenter ses données.</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Le cache de données topographiques vectorielles de l'Ontario a été créé à partir d’un grand nombre d’ensembles de données, comme on peut le lire dans le guide de l’utilisateur du cache. Si vous désirez obtenir les données faisant autorité, vous pouvez les télécharger auprès </span><a target='_blank' href='https://geohub-fr.lio.gov.on.ca/?locale=fr' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>CarrefourGéo Ontario</span></a><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>.</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Pour télécharger une copie du le cache de données topographiques d'ITO, visitez l'enregistrement </span><a target='_blank' href='https://mnrf.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=70587254227d44f78654152c1e0c5069' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Paquet de cache de données topographiques vectorielles de l'Ontario </span></a><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>, puis cliquez sur « Télécharger ».</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Additional Documentation / Documents supplémentaires</strong></span></div><div><ul><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Ontario-Vector-Topographic-Data-Cache-User-Guide.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Ontario Vector Topographic Data Cache - User Guide (DOCX)</span></a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Ontario-Vector-Topographic-Data-Cache-User-Guide-FR.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Cache de données topographiques vectorielles de l’Ontario - Guide de l’utilisateur (DOCX)</a><span style='color:#122030; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; font-size:28.0pt;'><span style='letter-spacing:.25pt;'>&nbsp;</span></span><br />&nbsp;</li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://mnrf.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=0007ddaa7c1a48d9bf667795feba012e' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Ontario Vector Topographic Data Cache - Tile Layer</span></a></li></ul></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Status / État</strong></span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>On going: Data is continually being updated</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Actives: Les données sont continuellement mises à jour</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency / Fréquence de mise à jour des données</strong></span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Biannually: data is updated twice each year</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Semestrielle: Les données sont mises à jour deux fois par an</span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'><strong>Contact / Personne-resource</strong></span><br />&nbsp;</div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Ontario Ministry of Natural Resources - Geospatial Ontario,&nbsp;</span><a href='mailto:geospatial@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>geospatial@ontario.ca</span></a></div><div><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>Ministère des Richesses naturelles de l’Ontario - Information géospatiale de l’Ontario,&nbsp;</span><a href='mailto:geospatial@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='display:inline !important; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-indent:0px;'>geospatial@ontario.ca</span></a></div>"
